## 3. EQUITY OWNERSHIP OFFER – 15%

Pixelix is pleased to propose an equity ownership interest of:

**15% (Fifteen Percent) of the Company's Fully Diluted Post-Issue Equity Share Capital.**

The proposed 15% equity participation shall be subject to:

1. Acceptance of this offer.
2. Agreement on the recipient's responsibilities and expected contribution.
3. Completion of the applicable company valuation and share-allotment process.
4. Approval by the Board of Directors and shareholders wherever required.
5. Execution of the Shareholders' Agreement and other applicable legal documents.
6. Completion of the statutory requirements for issuing and allotting shares.

The exact number and class of shares representing 15% shall be determined using the company's approved capital structure and applicable valuation.

The 15% ownership shall become effective only after the relevant shares have been legally issued and allotted and the recipient's name has been entered in the company's register of members.

